WEBVTT

00:07.520 --> 00:09.120
It seems I've lost

00:09.760 --> 00:11.160
Your son was lucky

00:12.280 --> 00:13.680
Wen Xian

00:13.920 --> 00:15.520
You've been watching for a while

00:15.600 --> 00:17.000
Give your assessment

00:17.360 --> 00:19.560
Prince of Jin is quick-witted

00:19.640 --> 00:22.320
His chess skills likely have no match in the palace

00:22.400 --> 00:23.760
Unlike Prince of Ning

00:23.840 --> 00:25.240
A terrible player

00:25.320 --> 00:25.840
Every time

00:25.920 --> 00:27.800
He gets something good and comes to the palace

00:27.880 --> 00:29.760
To gamble at chess with Your Majesty
